What is it?
-----------

RSP V1.0 [08-SEP-1997] PostCard Ware.

Rocks, Scissors & Paper is an old classic childs game played with your
hands. The object of the game is to win by throwing (showing) a better
hand than the other player. There are 3 basic hands that can be thrown
in order to try and win. The first is 'ROCK' which is a balled up fist.
The second, which is scissors, is the middle and pointer fingers showing
and spread apart. The last is paper which is a flat hand palm down.

Scoring goes as follows: Rock beats Scissors, Scissors beats paper and
paper beats rock. If you both show the same hand then that round is a
tie.

As always, Use at your own risk. It works great here but may bomb
elsewhere.

Installation:
-------------

Read History.Doc for past version notes.

1. Unarch the program :) Lets hope this part is already done.
2. Move the RSP directory to your Doors area.
3. Add this line to your bbsmenu if you like:
   {#0Doors:RSP/RSP}
   ^
   Remember that the { is a CTRL-Q character
   Also, add this to your games lists as a single player arexx program
   and disable More Mode.
4. Save :)
5. Edit the config options located in the program to your liking.
   * There are only 2 options in the program that you may wish to edit.
   One is the amount of extra time to award winners and the other is the
   PATH to the files should you opt to not put it in your Doors area.

Thats it! Simple.

Sysop Program Options:
----------------------

PATH='Doors:RSP/'  /* Path to your game files            */
treward=15         /* Time Reward for being a top player */

The numbers shown above are the defaults set in the program.

